  "details": "- Update to jdk-17.0.21.1+2 (OpenJDK Vulnerability Advisory 2026/11/17)\n- Includes the October 2026 CPU (jdk-17.0.21) and the 17.0.21.0.2 and\n  17.0.21.0.3 CA updates\n- Set fipsver to 028d2d4a596\n- Update bundled FreeType to 2.15.0 and libpng to 1.6.59\n- CVE-2026-114938: fix hotspot/compiler vulnerability\n- CVE-2026-114939: fix security-libs/org.ietf.jgss (Kerberos) vulnerability\n- CVE-2026-114940: fix security-libs/javax.net.ssl vulnerability\n- CVE-2026-114942: fix core-libs vulnerability\n- CVE-2026-114943: fix hotspot/runtime vulnerability\n- CVE-2026-114944: fix core-svc/java.lang.management vulnerability\n- CVE-2026-114945: fix core-libs/java.lang vulnerability\n- CVE-2026-114946: fix hotspot/compiler vulnerability",
